  "precision_rule": "Three significant figures, per docs/MODEL_CARD.md. The platform replication drift measured in Session 10 (pooled 0.0064, far-band 0.0307 on AUC) bounds how much of any small difference is real; a recall difference smaller than that bound is not a difference.",
  "not_comparable_to": "This project's ROC-AUC and these recall/precision figures are NOT comparable to NDWS PR-AUC or WSTS AP numbers. Three reasons, any one of which is sufficient: (1) the label here is 'this 500 m cell ignites by the NEXT SATELLITE OVERPASS' at overpass cadence, not next-day fire pixels on a fixed daily grid; (2) the IoU this project reports is over CUMULATIVE BURNED AREA, not next-day fire pixels; (3) the prevalence differs, and PR-AUC/AP move with prevalence by construction, so the same model scores differently on a differently-balanced set. Do not place these numbers in a table beside those benchmarks."
